This file is for the movement of the controllable charecter. 
This will contain the positional data, storing the x and y cords
This will also create and display the controllable character.

The flappy bird dysplay:
movement in x:
  will be a constant speed moving to the right
movement in y:
  if the player presses space, it will make the flappy bird jump up some pixles before gravity takes over
  will always have a gravity make the flappy bird fall to the ground exept when the jump key is pressed

if time: make a little animation for the jumping
if the bird is jumping, rotate the model so it tilts up
if the bird is falling, rotate the model down

INCLUDE Irvine32.inc

GROUND_ROW = 20
BIRD_CHAR = '>'

.data

birdX   BYTE 10
birdY   BYTE 10
birdVel SBYTE 0

.code
main PROC

call Clrscr
mov  dl, birdX
mov  dh, birdY
call Gotoxy
mov  al, BIRD_CHAR
call WriteChar

exit
main ENDP
END main
